IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sgta-nouns`

-- INSTRUMENT: Telecommunications (Class Licences) Regulations (Cap. 323, Rg 3), made under section 74 of the
-- Telecommunications Act (section 97 in the 2020 Revised Edition).  Texts used, all deposited in
-- subjects/sg/telecommunications-class-licences-regulations-2000/registers/source-bundle/: the 2002 Revised Edition
-- (TA1999-RG3) and S 685/2011 (TA1999-RG3-S685-2011, the e-Gazette copy, which has a text layer).  The regulations grant class licences to
-- OPERATORS of telecommunication systems and services (value-added networks, resale, payphones and so on).
-- Modelled in this file: reg 3, the grant itself, in its two forms.  Vintage: before 1 January 2003 -> NOTHING (the Revised
-- Edition's start date is not printed); 1 January 2003 to 27 December 2011; from 28 December 2011.

§ `Rg 3 regulation 3: class licence`

-- src:TA1999-RG3:78 | Class licence
-- src:TA1999-RG3:79 | 3. An operator shall, upon compliance with regulations 4 and 5, be deemed to have been
-- src:TA1999-RG3:80 | granted such class licence as may be appropriate to the type of specified
-- src:TA1999-RG3:81 | telecommunication systems and services run by him.
@ref Rg 3 reg 3, 2002 Revised Edition (src:TA1999-RG3:78-81)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `is an operator who runs specified telecommunication systems and services` IS A BOOLEAN
      `has complied with regulations 4 (registration) and 5 (fee)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 3 reg 3: the operator is deemed to have been granted a class licence` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 1 2003) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`is an operator who runs specified telecommunication systems and services` AND `has complied with regulations 4 (registration) and 5 (fee)`)

-- S 685/2011 substitutes reg 3 from 28 December 2011: the class licence is "under section 5 of the Act" and the holder of a
-- FBO licence or SBO (Individual) licence does not need one for the same systems and services.
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:63 | 3.—(1) An operator shall, upon compliance with regulations 4
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:64 | and 5, be deemed to have been granted a class licence under
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:65 | section 5 of the Act for the running of the types of specified
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:66 | telecommunication systems and services appropriate to the
-- src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:67 | telecommunication systems and services run by him.
@ref Rg 3 reg 3 as substituted by S 685/2011 (src:TA1999-RG3-S685-2011:63-67)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `is an operator who runs specified telecommunication systems and services` IS A BOOLEAN
      `has complied with regulations 4 (registration) and 5 (fee)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 3 reg 3 (from 28 December 2011): the operator is deemed to have been granted a class licence under section 5` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 28 12 2011) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`is an operator who runs specified telecommunication systems and services` AND `has complied with regulations 4 (registration) and 5 (fee)`)

